            <div xml:id="1906_09_01_SD_PS_001">
                <p>Som <occupation>husförest.</occupation> eller <occupation>hushållerska</occupation> söker <person sex="female" role="employee">bättre flicka</person>, <age value="27">27 år</age>, treflig plats till <date when="1906-10-01" type="begin">1 Okt.</date>
                    <trait type="experience">Innehaft likn. under 5 år</trait>. <ref type="reference">Fina ref.</ref>
                    <trait type="skill">Fullt kompetent</trait>. Svar till <person sex="unspecified" role="mediator">G. Larsson</person>, <street type="application">St. Tomegatan 25</street>, <placeName type="application" ref="#lund">Lund</placeName>.</p>
            </div>
